# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Internal planning, strategy and operations.
# This repo is PUBLIC. Nothing below this line goes to GitHub.
# These files stay on disk locally so Claude Code keeps working.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/CLAUDE.md
/CLAUDE-legacy-prototype.md
