# Source-resolution photography and unprocessed assets
/raw/

# Phase 3 image pipeline (scripts/build-images.mjs) landed 2026-07-30:
# /public/products/, /public/brands/ and /public/lithome/ now hold ONLY its
# committed AVIF/WebP/raster-fallback output, never source-resolution
# originals (those stay in gitignored /raw/ above) — see
# docs/13-IMAGE-BUDGET.md. The transitional rule that used to gitignore these
# two directories is lifted; do not reinstate it.

# Build-generated (emitted by scripts/gen-sitemap.mjs at prebuild)
/public/sitemap.xml
/public/robots.txt

# Build-generated (emitted by scripts/build-images.mjs; content-hash cache,
# not an asset — regenerated locally, never needed by CI or the deployed site).
# Moved out of public/ on 2026-08-06: anything under public/ is copied verbatim
# into dist/ and uploaded, so this was shipping build state to the production web
# root. The old path stays ignored in case a stale copy reappears there.
/.image-pipeline-cache.json
/public/.image-pipeline-cache.json

# Vendored third-party PHP fetched at build time by scripts/fetch-phpmailer.mjs,
# pinned + SHA-256 verified. Never committed: PHPMailer declares its own $Password
# property, which the fail-closed credential scanner blocks (by design).
public/api/vendor/

# Local question-and-answer sheet for Muneeb — never publish
document.md
